The easy thing to do is wait for a rock mole or dwarf to tunnel out to
you.  But you'll probably die of hunger first.

If you have unidentified wands, maybe one is a wand of digging.  Or
maybe it's a wand of lightning.  You want to be careful what you do with
it!

If all else fails, there's always prayer...

(I once had a game where I killed _2_ guards and got trapped _twice_
outside the same vault... first time I used method #3, second time
method #1.)

